sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: MPP failure: a used credential is sent again (replay)
  accDescr: Sequence diagram: MPP failure: a used credential is sent again (replay). 2 participants: Client (agent) and Resource server. 6 steps, 5 crossing a trust boundary. Based on stripe-mpp draft-httpauth-payment-01 (2026-09-09). Step 1: Client (agent) to Resource server: GET /v1/forecast. This step crosses a trust boundary. Step 2: Resource server to Client (agent): 402 with challenge. This step crosses a trust boundary. Step 3: Client (agent) to Resource server: First retry pays. This step crosses a trust boundary. Step 4: Client (agent) to Resource server: Same credential again. This step crosses a trust boundary. Step 5: Resource server to Resource server: Look up the id. Step 6: Resource server to Client (agent): 402, fresh challenge, invalid-challenge. This step crosses a trust boundary.
  autonumber
  participant p_client as Client (agent)
  participant p_server as Resource server
  p_client->>p_server: GET /v1/forecast
  Note over p_client,p_server: Crosses a trust boundary
  p_server-->>p_client: 402 with challenge
  Note over p_server,p_client: Crosses a trust boundary
  p_client->>p_server: First retry pays
  Note over p_client,p_server: Crosses a trust boundary
  p_client->>p_server: Same credential again
  Note over p_client,p_server: Crosses a trust boundary
  p_server->>p_server: Look up the id
  p_server-->>p_client: 402, fresh challenge, invalid-challenge
  Note over p_server,p_client: Crosses a trust boundary
